---
import SubpageLayout from '../../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
import ServicesGrid from '../../components/blocks/ServicesGrid.astro';
import Prose from '../../components/ui/Prose.astro';
---

<SubpageLayout
  title="About MyOrthodontist"
  description="A network of family-owned orthodontic offices serving communities across North Carolina and South Virginia — putting patients before profits for over 22 years."
  eyebrow="Our Story"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', href: '/' },
    { name: 'About', href: '/about/' },
  ]}
>
  <Prose>
    <h2>Who we are and why you should choose us</h2>
    <p>
      When it comes to the health of your teeth, nothing is more important than working with a
      trusted provider. MyOrthodontist is a network of family-owned orthodontic offices that serves
      numerous communities throughout North Carolina and South Virginia. We truly care about helping
      you and your family achieve your healthiest smiles.
    </p>
    <p>
      The caring professionals at MyOrthodontist are your partners in oral care. We take the time to
      address concerns and questions for you and your family, and we work with you to give you a
      healthy, dazzling smile through personal dental and orthodontic care — making it accessible,
      affordable, and pleasant.
    </p>
  </Prose>

  <ServicesGrid
    bare
    background="base"
    columns={3}
    eyebrow="What Makes Us Different"
    title="What sets us apart"
    titleLevel={2}
    items={[
      {
        icon: 'lucide:heart-handshake',
        title: 'Patients Before Profits',
        body: 'Every recommendation we make starts with what is best for you, not our bottom line. We take the time to understand your goals and build a plan that respects your budget.',
      },
      {
        icon: 'lucide:user-round',
        title: 'Exceptional Individualized Care',
        body: 'No two smiles are the same, and neither are two financial situations. We customize both your clinical care and your payment plan to fit your life.',
      },
      {
        icon: 'lucide:users',
        title: 'Working With the Community',
        body: 'From our roots in North Carolina, we serve the communities around us — committed to making orthodontic care accessible for every family, including those on Medicaid.',
      },
    ]}
  />

  <Prose>
    <h2>Our mission</h2>
    <p>
      Our mission is to deliver high-quality, professional oral health care. We treat our patients
      as family — irrespective of ethnicity, race, religion, or gender identity — giving them the
      same respect and consideration we would want ourselves through a pleasant and personalized
      experience. We strive to serve others in a caring and comfortable environment, and in the
      process grow as individuals and as a team.
    </p>
    <p>
      MyOrthodontist complies with applicable federal civil rights laws and does not discriminate on
      the basis of race, color, national origin, age, disability, or sex. We take reasonable steps
      to provide free-of-charge language assistance services to patients who do not speak English
      well enough to discuss the care we provide.
    </p>

    <h2>The MyOrthodontist story</h2>
    <p>
      Previously named The Happy Tooth Orthodontics, we have served North Carolina with great dental
      and orthodontic care for more than 22 years, and we have so many great stories to tell about
      the difference we have made in the lives of your friends, families, and neighbors.
    </p>
    <p>
      From humble beginnings and with roots here in North Carolina, we have built a culture and
      family that live our core values and build connection with all of our patients. Our offices
      and staff come to work every day striving to:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <a
          href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Zor-7eCBtRM"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="Core Values Series - Going, Above & Beyond on YouTube"
        >
          Go above and beyond
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YfDmm47EzjU"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="Core Values Series - Putting Others First on YouTube"
        >
          Put others first
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oEsaVnJjGDw"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="Core Values Series - Fun and Outgoing on YouTube"
        >
          Be fun and outgoing
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zl0ye_j06QE"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="Core Values Series - Be Genuine on YouTube"
        >
          Be genuine
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NtDL54_4slE"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="Core Values Series - A Level 5 Team Player on YouTube"
        >
          Be a team player
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We exist for you — to make a difference in your life and your smile. Since we exist for you,
      it is not about us, it is about you. We want you to have ownership in our offices, the
      process, and your results. So from your perspective, we are <strong>MyOrthodontist</strong>. A
      new name was born: simple, to the point, and one that makes you a part of the entire
      experience. This is not our name change — we are your new partner, MyOrthodontist.
    </p>
    <p><em>— Dr. Larry J. Moray</em></p>
  </Prose>

  <figure class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2">
    <div class="relative aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
      <iframe
        class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full border-0"
        src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/7b8Pl0ix7ew"
        title="WRAL Inside Look with Valonda Calloway — MyOrthodontist NC"
        loading="lazy"
        allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
        referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
        allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </div>
    <figcaption class="text-ink-muted text-sm">WRAL Inside Look with Valonda Calloway</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <Prose>
    <h2>Honest, caring service</h2>
    <p>
      At MyOrthodontist, we care about our patients and treat them like family. We promise to speak
      honestly with you about any symptoms that may require further treatment. Our experienced
      dental professionals outline every treatment option in a way you can understand and answer
      your questions, so you can make your orthodontic treatment decisions with confidence.
    </p>
  </Prose>
</SubpageLayout>
